<http://purl.org/biotop/biotop.owl#Condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.org/biotop/biotop.owl#Particular> .
<http://purl.org/biotop/biotop.owl#Disposition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/biotop/biotop.owl#Disposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "disposition" .
